# Supabase

Schema is represented only by ordered migrations and reproducible seed files.
Never test mutations against a remote URL. Before database tests or reset,
require the configured Supabase URL host to be `127.0.0.1`, `localhost`, or
`::1`. Run `supabase db lint --local --fail-on error` for schema changes.
